-- SURVIVOR (S7). A file with inline tests, all passing, in the form the
-- syntactic derivation recognises. It must never be reported by any rule.
-- If a mutant makes this file appear in the report, the guard fires too much.

module tools/test_coverage/fixtures/control_has_tests

